lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMrs. Wang's family situation is average, but Mrs. Wang's daughter, Xiaoyun, is very smart and studious, Mrs. Wang places high hopes on her. After she graduates with a doctorate, she chooses a social work position, helping the disadvantaged groups in the community.\n\n[Question]\nMrs. Wang should feel relieved that her daughter chooses to be a social worker, but why does she actually seem disappointed?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mrs. Wang feels that her daughter's choice of work does not take into account the spiritual support from home.\nB. Mrs. Wang thinks her daughter chooses a job that is not stable enough.\nC. Mrs. Wang feels that her daughter should continue to study, not work directly.\nD. Mrs. Wang originally hopes her daughter can help them alleviate financial pressure, but her daughter does not choose a more economically rewarding profession.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266669876803393,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52ae0c2ddb05a7fe2f1ac","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452192642,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:56:32","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"aedbb210321e4456b91f8910d8c3b2df"}